meta {
  name: Update Server - Apply Infrastructure Update
  type: http
  seq: 8
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/:id
  body: json
  auth: none
}

params:path {
  id: your-server-id
}

body:json {
  {
    "name": "my-pack-server",
    "region": "europe-west3",
    "zone": "europe-west3-a",
    "machineType": "e2-standard-4",
    "diskSizeGB": 50,
    "minecraftVersion": ""
  }
}

docs {
  Apply a pending infrastructure update to a server whose `outdated` flag is true (shown as "Infrastructure Update Available" in the settings dialog). Send the current configuration back unchanged; rewriting `metadata.user-data` recreates the VM. See the Infrastructure Version Migrations section of docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.
}
